sequenceDiagram
    participant IKLN as IKLN Control Plane<br/>BPNL00000002IKLN
    participant Proxy as DIM Wallet Proxy
    participant Wallet as SSI Wallet Stub<br/>Issuer: BPNL00000003CRHK
    participant MASS as MASS Control Plane<br/>BPNL00000000MASS
    
    Note over IKLN,MASS: Fase 1: Obtención de Credenciales (IATP)
    IKLN->>Proxy: 1. Request credentials for MASS
    Proxy->>Wallet: 2. Get DID document for MASS
    Wallet-->>Proxy: 3. DID document
    Proxy->>Wallet: 4. Get Verifiable Presentation (VP)
    Wallet-->>Proxy: 5. VP (JWT with VCs)
    Proxy-->>IKLN: 6. Credentials
    
    Note over IKLN,MASS: Fase 2: Catalog Request via DSP Protocol
    IKLN->>MASS: 7. POST /api/v1/dsp (Catalog request + VP)
    
    Note over MASS,Wallet: Fase 3: Verificación y Respuesta
    MASS->>Wallet: 8. Verify VP signature and VCs
    Wallet-->>MASS: 9. Verification OK
    MASS-->>IKLN: 10. Catalog response (Assets + Policies)
